\par\par \b \uc2 Southeast Asian Stocks,  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Extend Slide\b0\par\par\uc2 By Abhrajit Gangopadhyay and Nopparat Chaichalearmmongkol   \par \uc2 515 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 August 2013\par 11:33\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 Stocks and \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell in Southeast Asia's major markets Tuesday, reflecting concern that foreign investors and firms will be investing less in the region as they shift their focus to opportunities for better growth and returns in developed economies.\par \par \uc2 The Stock Exchange of Thailand's composite index tracked steep declines in Indonesian stock prices, slipping 2.8% to reach its lowest level in eight weeks by midday.\par \par \uc2 The selloff started Monday after the Thai government's economic planning agency reported second-quarter gross domestic product growth of only 2.8% compared with a year earlier. GDP declined 0.3% on quarter.\par \par \uc2 Funds have been perceptibly drifting out of emerging markets and into developed markets, which are showing signs of recovery, said Komsorn Prakopphol, an analyst at \uc2 Tisco Financial Group\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Mr. Komsorn said that although growth potential in Asia will continue to make it "an interesting investment destination over the long term," the short-term prognosis is for the outflow of funds to continue.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lost ground against the dollar, weakening by more than 1% Tuesday. It hit a low of 31.74 baht per dollar around 0310 GMT, its weakest level in more than a year.\par \par \uc2 Malaysia's shares fell as much as 2%, while the ringgit swooned to a fresh three-year low against the U.S. dollar. The benchmark FBM KLCI has shed 2.8% over the past five sessions to end Tuesday at 1745.42. So far this year, it has eked out a 3.5% rise compared with a 10% gain over the course of 2012.\par \par \uc2 "The weakness isn't specific to Malaysia, as there is a massive outflow of funds from emerging markets" around the world, said the chief investment officer at TA Investment Management, Choo Swee Kee, who manages the equivalent of 700 million ringgit ($213 million) in Malaysian assets.\par \par \uc2 The ringgit declined against the greenback for a seventh straight session. Investors say they are worried that a shrinking trade surplus will squeeze Malaysia's current-account surplus and possibly push it into deficit territory for the first time since 1997. \uc2 Bank Negara Malaysia\uc2  will release data on second-quarter economic growth and balance of payments on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Earlier Tuesday, \uc2 Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to rescue the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from a sharp decline, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is suspected to have sold more than a billion dollars in the spot market after the ringgit touched 3.30 to a dollar, dealers familiar with its actions said. \uc2 Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't comment on \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It has said that when it takes actions, they are only aimed at reducing market volatility.\par \par \uc2 "At the moment, there is a lot of momentum behind the [dollar] rally, and it is hard to identify any significant changes that could reverse its direction," said Goh Khoon, a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at \uc2 ANZ Bank\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Write to Abhrajit Gangopadhyay at Abhrajit.gangopadhyay@dowjones.com and Nopparat Chaichalearmmongkol at nopparat.chaichalearmmongkol@dowjones.com [ 20-08-13 0933GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130820e98k000cb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
