\par\par \b \uc2 Malaysia c.bank says orderly  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  market important\b0\par\par\uc2 440 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 November 2010\par 11:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  says markets have been orderly\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in market- economist\par \par \uc2 * Ringgit has moved within 300-350 bps range of dollar\par \par \uc2 KUALA LUMPUR, Nov 10 (Reuters) - Malaysia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Wednesday that an orderly \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was important, underlining expectations that the authority would continue to conduct smoothing \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent ringgit volatility.\par \par \uc2 Indeed, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders said that \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively in the market on Wednesday to buy dollars. [ID:nSGE6A90B5]\par \par \uc2 Emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are under upward pressure from a flood of capital inflows seeking higher returns compared with developed nations and a number of countries have imposed measures to control the flow.\par \par \uc2 "We are pleased to say that our \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market has been very orderly," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's governor, Zeti Akhtar Aziz, told reporters on the sidelines of a business conference.\par \par \uc2 "We have said from the very beginning there's going to be increased volatility because of increased uncertainty," she said.\par \par \uc2 "We are on record to say orderly \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets are very important for a highly open economy like Malaysia."\par \par \uc2 The Malaysian ringgit <MYR=> is Asia's third best-performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  behind the Japanese yen <JPY=> and the Thai baht <THB=>, with gains of more than 10 percent versus the dollar. It was last at 3.088 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Analysts expect Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to appreciate further, as a second round of U.S. quantitative easing drives capital into emerging economies.\par \par \uc2 Gundy Cahyadi, an economist at \uc2 OCBC Bank\uc2 , said the Malaysian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could step into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to prevent excessive volatility.\par \par \uc2 "It is important to note that for the most part, we think this is in the spirit of smoothing flows in the market, rather than a draconian measure aimed to stop the ringgit from being stronger," Cahyadi said.\par \par \uc2 "Bank Negara has previously stated that it may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the market is not orderly, and we think they may just do that, as excessive volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is bad for the economy as a whole."\par \par \uc2 CIMB's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist Suresh Ramanathan said the ringgit market had been orderly.\par \par \uc2 "Even with the dollar rallying in the last two days, the ringgit has been declining in an orderly fashion," he said.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar rallied on Wednesday to its highest level against a basket of major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  since late October. [ID:nSGE6A905L] (Reporting by Fong Min Hun; Editing by Neil Fullick) ((fong.minhun@thomsonreuters.com; +603-2333-8039; bureau email areuters@gmail.com))\par \par \uc2 MALAYSIA-ECONOMY/|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|SI|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101110e6ba0010p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
