\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ Malaysia  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Gov: Country Firmly In Recovery Growth Path\b0\par\par\uc2 326 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Oktober 2010\par 07:22\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2010, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 26 Oct 2010 01:22 EDT *DJ  Malaysia Zeti: Can Achieve 6% GDP Growth In 2011\par \par \uc2 26 Oct 2010 01:23 EDT *DJ  Malaysia Zeti: Ringgit Exchange Rate Determined By The Market\par \par \uc2 26 Oct 2010 01:23 EDT *DJ  Malaysia Zeti: Ringgit Trend Reflects Underlying Fundamentals\par \par \uc2 26 Oct 2010 01:23 EDT *DJ  Malaysia Zeti: No Inflationary Pressure At This Time\par \par \uc2 26 Oct 2010 01:24 EDT *DJ  Malaysia Zeti: Interest Rate At Appropriate Level\par \par \uc2 26 Oct 2010 01:24 EDT *DJ  Malaysia Zeti: No Asset Bubble Forming\par \par \uc2 26 Oct 2010 01:26 EDT *DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Zeti: \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  To \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  To Ensure Orderly \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  Market\par \par \uc2 26 Oct 2010 01:49 EDT DJ  Malaysia \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Gov: Ringgit Trend Reflects Underlying Fundamentals\par \par \uc2 KUALA LUMPUR (Dow Jones)--\uc2 Bank Negara Malaysia\uc2  Governor Zeti Akhtar Aziz Tuesday said the ringgit's strengthening against the U.S. dollar reflects underlying fundamentals, adding that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is prepared to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if market conditions turn disorderly.\par \par \uc2 Zeti said the ringgit has been relatively stable compared to other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , even though it has appreciated about 10% against the greenback this year.\par \par \uc2 "So far, the trend reflects our underlying fundamentals," Zeti told reporters on the sidelines of an Islamic finance conference.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is well-positioned to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if conditions become disorderly, or if there are excessive movements taking place within a very short period of time. But so far we have been very pleased that the market has remained orderly," she added.\par \par \uc2 Zeti also said that interest rates remain at appropriate levels and that there is currently no inflationary pressure.\par \par \uc2 Malaysia remains firmly on a growth path and can achieve gross domestic product expansion of 6% in 2011, she added.\par \par \uc2 -By K.P. Lee, Dow Jones Newswires; 603-2026-1233; kwan-por.lee@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 October 26, 2010 01:49 ET (05:49 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020101026e6aq000v6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
