\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia \highlight\uc2  to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  if ringgit "disorderly"-c.bank\b0\par\par\uc2 387 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Oktober 2010\par 07:39\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * C.bank will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if ringgit becomes "disorderly"\par \par \uc2 * Sees no inflationary pressures right now\par \par \uc2 * Economic growth will moderate (Adds details)\par \par \uc2 KUALA LUMPUR, Oct 26 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets if movements in the ringgit <MYR=> become "disorderly", its governor Zeti Akhtar Aziz said on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The ringgit has risen 10.5 percent against the dollar this year as investors pump cash into higher yielding emerging market assets, making it Asia's third-best performer among the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  monitored daily by Reuters.\par \par \uc2 "It (the ringgit) is dependent on the inflows or outflows and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is well positioned to undertake any sort of... \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market if conditions become disorderly or very excessive movements taking place within a very short period of time," Zeti told reporters.\par \par \uc2 Zeti added there will be volatility and uncertainty in major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , not just in the ringgit.\par \par \uc2 The Malaysian central governor's comments come after the G20 partners pledged that advanced economies would be vigilant against disorderly exchange rate movements. [ID:nTOE69M002]\par \par \uc2 Japanese Finance Minister Yoshihiko Noda said earlier on Tuesday that Japan would take decisive steps on \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  when needed, after Tokyo \b \highlight22\uc2 intervented\b0 \highlight\uc2  in mid-September to try to slow the yen's rise. [ID:nTKF107056]\par \par \uc2 A number of other Asian authorities have also been actively \b \highlight22\uc2 interventing\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem sharp appreciation of their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , fearing it could hit exports and stifle economic growth. Some other emerging economies such as Brazil have also taken steps to control foreign inflows. <^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\par \par \uc2 For a table on estimates of daily Asia c.bank \b \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , click: [ID:nSGE69O054]\par \par \uc2 For a list of countries attempting to curb hot money inflows, see [ID:nSGE69503F] ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^>\par \par \uc2 Zeti also said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not see inflationary pressures at this point of time and it had the flexibility to contain any asset bubbles.\par \par \uc2 The economy would remain firmly on a growth path, but there will be moderation, she said.\par \par \uc2 On new licences for foreign banks, Zeti said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hoped to announce later this year at least one licence for a mega Islamic bank.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Royce Cheah; Writing by Niluksi Koswanage; Editing by Neil Fullick)\par \par \uc2 MALAYSIA-ECONOMY/ (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|SI|ABX|BNX|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101026e6aq000ah\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
