\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bk:  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  Only To Maintain Orderly  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Mkt\b0\par\par\uc2 197 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 August 2008\par 04:34\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 KUALA LUMPUR (Dow Jones)--Bank Negara Malaysia Governor Zeti Akhtar Aziz said Monday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market only to maintain orderly conditions.\par \par \uc2 She also said the current weakness in the ringgit reflects the general trend of the strengthening dollar against many \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and that it is an "international development."\par \par \uc2 "Any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  that we undertake is to maintain orderly market conditions; that is our priority," Zeti said.\par \par \uc2 "We will not be \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to affect the underlying trend of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," she said.\par \par \uc2 She added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to monitor the market closely.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar has risen to MYR3.3200 Monday, the highest level so far this year, compared with MYR3.2630 a week ago.\par \par \uc2 Dealers suspect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market for the past one week by selling the dollar to slow the weakening of the ringgit. The greenback has risen against major and regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  largely due to falling crude oil prices.\par \par \uc2 - K.P. Lee; Dow Jones Newswires; 603-2168 4273; kwan-por.lee@dowjones.com [ 11-08-08 0302GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080811e48b0002s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
