\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Asian c.banks support  \highlight22\uc2 currencies \highlight\uc2 , welcome weakness   \b0\par\par\uc2 514 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 August 2007\par 05:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (adds comments, other central banks)   \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE, Aug 10 (Reuters) - Central banks in \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Taiwan and elsewhere in Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell dollars on Friday to support their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  during a broad sell-off of riskier assets, but some policy makers openly welcomed the weakness.   \par \par \uc2 The Indonesian and Philippine central banks were also suspected of selling dollars through state-owned banks to stem falls in the peso and rupiah.   \par \par \uc2 The Philippine peso <PHP=> fell nearly a percent from Thursday's close before being supported at the day's low of 45.75.   \par \par \uc2 "I heard they sold dollars at 45.75 and I am still seeing offers at that level," said a trader in Manila, referring to suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 The Indonesian rupiah <IDR=> continued to hit one-year lows.   \par \par \uc2 At the same time, Indonesian Vice President Jusuf Kalla told reporters weakness in the rupiah, already Asia's worst performer this year, should be good for the country's exports.   \par \par \uc2 The Bank of Thailand, which was rumoured to have bought dollars to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the past week, barely flinched during the baht's <THB=TH> quarter percent decline to 34.09 per dollar.   \par \par \uc2 David Mann, a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Standard Chartered Bank, said the Asian central banks were quite possibly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  just to smooth movements in their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 "They are happy to see some more two-way risks priced into the market rather than a one-way bet mentality," he said.   \par \par \uc2 "In my view, they are also quite glad to see a correction in the over-enthusiastic pricing of risk."   \par \par \uc2 The sell-off in risky assets gathered momentum on Thursday after news French bank  \uc2 BNP Paribas\uc2  had frozen funds hit by the troubled U.S. subprime mortgage sector. The European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  pumped funds into European money markets and the U.S. Federal Reserve also injected cash on a smaller scale.   \par \par \uc2 The Malaysia ringgit <MYR=> fell to 3.48 per dollar, a low point seen at the end of June, before suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Traders said the Malaysian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars around 3.4780/90.   \par \par \uc2 However, a senior Bank of Korea official said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not supply dollars to ease what it regarded as a lack of short-term supplies in the market.   \par \par \uc2 Singapore's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it stood ready to supply funds to the market if needed.   \par \par \uc2 Still, the Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  stayed close to their lows, with the ringgit quoted near 3.48.   \par \par \uc2 "I think they are in the market to smooth excessive volatility," said Emmanuel Ng, a strategist at  \uc2 OCBC Bank.\par \par \uc2 "In this environment, especially with central banks like the ECB, Fed and the BOJ injecting liquidity to forestall any systemic stress, the market is understandably jittery.   \par \par \uc2 "In such a scenario, further weakness in Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  cannot be ruled out, simply because of risk aversion and the fact that funds may have to be re-channelled," he said.   \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-ASIA/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 3)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|SI|PHD|IF|Z|ABX|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070810e38a0006p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
